          "Address the renter cohort (30.8%) as an economic opportunity: young professionals and renters in established suburban neighborhoods are not automatically Democratic, but they are economically mobile and responsive to arguments about housing costs, job growth, and opportunity. A candidate who speaks to why this district's economic model serves renters as well as homeowners is defending the margin more effectively.",
