          "Avoid immigration and culture-war escalation: the 61-39 margin suggests Republicans have already locked in White voter support on these issues; relitigating them wastes persuasion capacity.",
          "Target younger, educated renters as swing bloc: this cohort overlaps heavily on cost-of-living and education concerns and is less ideologically rigid than older or non-college-educated voters; direct outreach on economic opportunity is higher-ROI than broad demographic appeals."
