          "Lead with working-class economic security: healthcare affordability, housing cost management, and wage viability are the material concerns of a $59,965 median-income constituency with 22.3% renter exposure. If the incumbent has not demonstrated concrete legislative attention to these issues, a challenger who does can close from 24% to competitive range rapidly.",
