          { name: "Partisan Ideology Over Constituent Pragmatism", tag: "avoid", why: "TN-HD-44's constituency is affluent, educated, and pragmatic — they evaluate on whether government delivers tangible results for their economic security and children's future, not on partisan theater or ideological purity. A legislator who prioritizes abstract conservative positioning, culture-war signaling, or partisan loyalty over school funding adequacy, infrastructure investment, or property tax management will gradually alienate the educated homeowners who form the district's core and find themselves vulnerable to a credible challenger who promises effective local governance. This district punishes ideological rigidity and rewards results." }
