          "Avoid ideological overreach: this constituency is pragmatic and results-focused. Candidates who prioritize partisan theater, culture-war signaling, or ideological purity over school funding adequacy, fiscal responsibility, and infrastructure delivery will gradually lose the educated homeowners who form the district's core and create space for opposition challenge."
