          "Lead with kitchen-table economic messaging: cost of living, healthcare affordability, and job stability are the material concerns of a working-class constituency at this income and education profile; abstract conservative or progressive positioning will not resonate as strongly as concrete policy answers to whether government is delivering for working families.",
