          "Recognize that the 2022 unopposed result is not evidence of safety but of current incumbent credibility; any successor — whether from the same party or opposite — must immediately establish the same constituent relationship depth or risk a genuine challenge in 2026; this seat's fundamentals are persuadable, not locked."
