          "Monitor whether the incumbent is actually delivering legislative victories on cost-of-living issues or defaulting to cultural-conservative positioning that generates electoral loyalty but leaves economic grievance unaddressed — the latter is the vulnerability that creates opening for credible Democratic challenge."
