          { name: "Overlooking the District's Demographic Vulnerability to Messaging Around Healthcare and Education Investment", tag: "avoid", why: "A district with only 18.3% college attainment and median income in the bottom quartile is a constituency whose children face real barriers to educational mobility and whose families face acute healthcare access and affordability constraints. Messaging that frames education funding and healthcare expansion as wasteful or fiscally irresponsible will be experienced as hostile to the material circumstances of people living in TN-SD-24. Any candidate — incumbent or challenger — who defaults to abstract fiscal conservatism without addressing how education and healthcare investment serves this specific district's working families is misreading the electoral terrain." }
